[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
itefan talks to the hardware directly. Check the readings first:

  itefan                       # fan should show rpm on its channel

Find the lowest speed at which the fan still spins:

  itefan pct 3 25 ; sleep 5 ; itefan

Then enable the temperature-driven service:

  sysrc kld_list+=coretemp
  sysrc fancurve_enable=YES
  service fancurve start

All settings and how the fan reacts are explained in fancurve(8);
the tool itself in itefan(8):

  man fancurve
  man itefan

Settings take effect after "service fancurve restart".
EOM
}
